WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.650
[Soft ambient tones]
After hours. An exhibition after dark.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.900
Nocturne Hall. A red ring turns among spotlit paintings.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:08.050
Scarlet Room. Red orbits turn against the dark.

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:11.850
Night Garden. Floating forms drift beneath a curved light.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:14.750
Obsidian Room. Faceted shapes hover over a lit platform.

00:00:15.050 --> 00:00:16.900
Step inside.
